  - Queen
  - Princess
  - Dragon
  sentences:
  - Now the tounrnament can beguin. Princess, I am here to win your heart!
  - Now that's more interesting!
  - You... you want my daughter's hand in mariage?
  - 
  - I don't want your daughter, I want my princess, the beautiful lady with pink
    hair.
  - '*Giggles*'
  - ...That's my daughter.
  - Mother please say yes! Didn't you say the tournament was open to anyone willing?
  - '*Sigh* I did say so. If you win, you can marry my daughter.'
  - Do your best, dragon!
  - I fear no one! I shall win promptly, my princess!
